<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: left">Emerging growth company <span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span id="xdx_907_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20260728__20260728_z54j0hRGkTq6"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2026-07-28" format="ixt:booleanfalse" id="Fact000027" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 11.3pt">&#160;</p>

